c_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOHoQYiRotcPsgI7EQfEfxMm6P2g_7xt_sBihc6F-I9cw&oe=6AC27D33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ReFlex", "keywords": ["rehab", "concussion", "training", "eye"], "long_description": "# ReFlex: Ocular Motor VR Rehab\n\n**ReFlex** is a clinically inspired VR platform engineered to train and restore ocular motor skills through immersive, guided exercises. Designed for therapists, clinics, and neuro-rehab programs, ReFlex pairs precise real-time eye-tracking analytics with structured protocols to deliver objective, data-driven outcomes.\n\n---\n\n## Core Capabilities\n\n* **Real-Time Eye-Tracking:** Evaluates spatial accuracy, response timing, and motor control during exercises to generate immediate, quantifiable performance scores.\n* **24+ Therapeutic Protocols:** Targets specific deficits with exercises for **saccades**, **smooth pursuit**, **fixation**, and **binocular coordination**.\n* **Progress Dashboard:** Syncs session data to a secure platform to monitor long-term recovery trends, adjust treatment plans, and validate outcomes.\n* **Immersive VR Design:** Maximizes patient engagement and therapy compliance while maintaining strict clinical rigor.\n\n---\n\n## Clinical Applications\n\n* **Neuro-Rehabilitation:** Post-stroke recovery, concussion management, and TBI rehab.\n* **Vision & Vestibular Therapy:** Gaze stability, pursuit deficits, and binocular dysfunctions.\n* **Clinical Research:** Standardized testing for observational and interventional studies.\n\n---\n\nReFlex modernizes visual rehabilitation by combining VR immersion, sub-degree eye-tracking precision, and actionable analytics in one seamless workflow.", "short_description": "ReFlex is a clinically inspired VR rehabilitation app designed to train and improve ocular motor skills through immersive, guided exercises. Built for therapists, clinics, and research-driven rehab programs, ReFlex combines precise eye-tracking analytics with engaging VR protocols to deliver measurable results.\n\nUsing real-time eye tracking, ReFlex evaluates how users perform during each exercise\u2014capturing accuracy, timing, and control\u2014to generate objective performance scores."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://neuroflex.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Saccade Analytics Inc. ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.neuroflex.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28443458555345544"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1053837830975977"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1053837830975977"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790604000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1053837830975977"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28202154786142590", "version": "R0.7.0"}, "id": "1442115487308843", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25854084470949645", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28202154786142590"}, "release_sta